      69.84,
      415.2,
      310.0,
      449.27
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following land which are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      463.2,
      310.12,
      545.27
    ],
    "text": "The land allotments of land described below in total extentof 0.5495 Hectares, shown as 01 and 02 in the preliminaryplan dated 2018-12-31 for Gam 4123 prepared by the SurveyorGeneral situated in Village of Nawammahara, the minordivision of Ragam Paththuwa in the Divisional Secretary'sDivision of Wattala in the District of Gampaha, in WesternProvince and bounded as follows:",
