    "text": "Name of land : Kajugahakumbura ; Description: Canal;Claimant: Janaka Ambagahawatte, No. 18/3, Sun CityApartment, St. Anthony's lane, Colombo 03; Original Claiment:- ; Extent : 0.4885 Hectare.",
