  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      404.4,
      562.37,
      510.47
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Wattala on the24th Day of April, 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requestedto notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 24thday of April, 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
